  "Question": "Point \\(P(a,b)\\) lies in the second quadrant. The reflection of \\(P\\) across the \\(x\\)-axis lies in:",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "The third quadrant",
    "B": "The first quadrant",
    "C": "The second quadrant",
    "D": "The fourth quadrant"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "In the second quadrant, \\(a<0\\) and \\(b>0\\). The reflection across the \\(x\\)-axis is \\((a,-b)\\). Both coordinates are then negative, so it lies in the third quadrant.",
